<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italy 18, 24-mo CTZ auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italy 18, 24-mo CTZ auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 1.5 trillion lire auction of a third tranche of 18-month December 30, 1998 Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ), and 2.0 trillion lire auction of a first tranche of July 15, 1999 two-year CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Dec 30, 98  Pvs    July 15, 99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 5.21 pct    5.31   5.16 pct    5.29</p>
<p>Gross Yield     5.95	  6.06   5.88	  6.08</p>
<p>Assigned price 91.90	 91.55  89.20	 89.55</p>
<p>Bids	     3.33 trillion lire   4.34 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 1.5  trillion lire   2.0  trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The two-year CTZ results are compared with those at the previous June 25 auction of a seventh tranche of May 14, 1999 certificates.</p>
</text>
